    "sections": {
        "description": "The Cargo and Shipping Company Theme is a modern, fully responsive, and professional solution designed for logistics companies, cargo services, freight forwarding businesses, shipping agencies, transport companies, courier services, supply chain management firms, import export companies, and international shipping operators aiming to build a strong online presence. Ideal for showcasing logistics services, freight solutions, cargo transportation, shipment tracking, delivery management, warehousing services, customs clearance, and global trade operations, the theme offers multiple customizable sections, a clean Bootstrap-based layout, and SEO-optimized, lightweight code for fast loading and better search visibility. It seamlessly integrates with essential plugins such as WooCommerce for service payments and bookings, Contact Form 7 for customer inquiries and quote requests, WPML for multilingual shipping websites, and Yoast SEO for improved search rankings, while Google Maps integration helps clients easily locate offices, ports, or warehouses. Built specifically for cargo, shipping, logistics, and transportation professionals, this theme provides a polished, user-friendly, and conversion-focused platform to promote services, highlight expertise, and build customer trust, making it an excellent choice for growing logistics and shipping businesses."
    },
